# frontend/src/features/community — Community decks (v2 SPA)

Desktop `/community` page plus the shared community deck grid used by the page, the
read-only public profile, and the mobile Decks tabs.

## Files
- `CommunityPage.tsx` — desktop `/community` route. Tabbed layout (Community with
  character/location search, Your Favorites, Tournament). See `CommunityPage.md`.
- `CommunityDeckGrid.tsx` — reusable grid of `DeckTile variant="full"` with max-stat icons
  (`deckMaxStats`/`buildCharStatsById` from `lib/decks/deckMaxStats.ts`), owner display
  names, and favorite hearts. Reused by `DeckSelectionPage` (public profile + mobile tabs).
- `CommunityPage.css` — page + tab toolbar styling (`.community__tabs`, `.community__toolbar`).

## Data / API
- `lib/api/favorites.ts`: `fetchCommunityFeed(search?)`, `fetchFavoriteDecks()`,
  `fetchPublicDecksForUser(userId)`, `addFavorite`/`removeFavorite`.
- Favorite mutations: `lib/decks/useFavoriteToggle.ts` (optimistic + invalidate).
- Backend: `GET /api/v1/community/decks`, `GET /api/v1/users/:userId/public-decks`,
  `GET /api/v1/decks/favorites`, `POST`/`DELETE /api/v1/decks/:id/favorite`
  (`CommunityService` / `src/api/http/community.http.ts`). See `API_V1.md`.

## Conventions
- Only `is_private = false` decks appear here; curated accounts are excluded from the feed.
- Hearts/owner names hidden for the deck owner and for guests (guests see no heart).
- Tournament decks lack server-side `isFavorited`; `CommunityPage` derives their heart state
  from the favorites cache and toggles that cache so hearts stay correct on reload.
- Visual spec: `STYLE_GUIDE_V2.md` § "Community page (v2 SPA)" and
  § "Public/private visibility chip & favorite heart (v2 SPA)".
